<TR><TD bgcolor=2F4F2F><font size=+1 color=FFFFFF>11/17/99</font></TD></TR>
<TR><TD><font size=+1 color=FFFFFF>Close Encounters of the EQ Kind? </font><font size=-1 color=FFFFFF>
</font>
<HR>
<font size=-1 color =FFFFFF><P>

Long long ago, when I was but a wee lad, I saw a strange orb floating over 
the hills of Qeynos.  When I shouted this, there were two others whom had 
also seen this orb, but the word of three people carried no weight and we 
were laughed at and told we did nea know what we were talking about.  Many 
years have passed since that time, but to my terror, on an eve this past 
week, I looked up in the sky and once more I saw a strange...circle, flying 
high in the sky.
<BR>This is no wizard spell gone awry and I hope these images will prove as 
such.
<BR><BR>
<a href=http://www.solusekro.com/gallery/closeEq1.jpg>[Image 1]</a><BR>
<a href=http://www.solusekro.com/gallery/closeEQ21.jpg>[Image 2]</a><BR><a href=http://www.solusekro.com/gallery/closeEQ3.jpg>[Image 3]</a><BR>


<BR>
 - Atlus Baldrickson<BR><BR>
</P></font>
</TD></TR>

